# MidHub reverse-proxy block.
# Paste INSIDE AgentHub's existing site block(s) in /etc/caddy/Caddyfile (both the
# https://10.4.150.142 and http://dev-agenthub.mfec.co.th sites), BEFORE any catch-all
# handle / reverse_proxy to :3000, so /midhub/* is matched first.
# Upload limit: AgentHub's site has a site-level `request_body { max_size 50MB }`, which Caddy
# applies BEFORE `handle`. Default (option b): leave AgentHub untouched; the effective MidHub
# upload limit is then slightly under 50 MB (Caddy answers 413 for bigger bodies; the UI says
# "ไม่เกิน 50 MB"). Optional (option a): wrap AgentHub's reverse_proxy + request_body in a
# trailing `handle { }` to allow a full 50 MB file. See deploy/README.md (back up + validate).
	@midhub path /midhub /midhub/*
	handle @midhub {
		# 50 MB uploads + multipart framing (app proxyClientMaxBodySize = 51mb)
		request_body {
			max_size 51MB
		}
		reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:3100 {
			header_up X-Forwarded-For {client_ip}
			# Do not buffer: live log tail is SSE.
			flush_interval -1
		}
	}
